    "category": [
      "laptops-accessories"
    ],
    "description": "A 16-inch business laptop with a WUXGA (1920 x 1200) anti-glare display, Intel Core Ultra 5 processor, 16GB of DDR5 RAM and a 512GB SSD. Aluminium build, backlit keyboard with number pad, fingerprint reader in the power button, Wi-Fi 6E, and HDMI, USB-A and USB-C ports. Windows 11 Pro.",
    "brand": "Lenovo",
    "is_active": true,
    "created_at": "2026-10-25T04:58:51.469Z"
