    "category": [
      "laptops-accessories"
    ],
    "description": "A Copilot+ PC with a 13.8-inch PixelSense Flow touchscreen (up to 120Hz), a Snapdragon X Plus processor with a built-in NPU for on-device AI, 16GB of RAM and a 512GB SSD. Up to 20 hours of video playback, two USB4 (USB-C) ports plus USB-A, a backlit keyboard and a large haptic touchpad. Windows 11 Home.",
    "brand": "Microsoft",
    "is_active": true,
