    ],
    "description": "A big-screen Galaxy with flagship features: a 6.7-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display at 120Hz, Exynos 2400 processor and 8GB of RAM. Triple rear camera (50MP main, 12MP ultra-wide, 8MP 3x telephoto) and a 12MP selfie camera. 4,900mAh battery with 45W fast charging, IP68 water and dust resistance, Galaxy AI, and 7 years of OS and security updates.",
