    "slug": "samsung-galaxy-s25",
    "category": [
      "smartphones"
    ],
    "description": "Samsung's compact flagship: a 6.2-inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X display at up to 120Hz, the Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy processor and 12GB of RAM. Triple rear camera (50MP main, 12MP ultra-wide, 10MP 3x telephoto) that records up to 8K video, with Galaxy AI tools such as Circle to Search and Live Translate built in. 4,000mAh battery with fast wired and wireless charging, IP68 rating, and 7 years of OS and security updates.",
